      "writtenOn": "2019-10-21T22:43:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As far as I read the code correctly, all hook handlers don\u0027t need to be called on the first transition if we assume tablet_mode\u003d\u003ddisabled. That\u0027ll remove the complexity and remove the redundancy (i.e. skip setting a GPIO which is already set, skip enabling keyscan which is already enabled, skip notifying the host which already knows it\u0027s in clamshell, etc.).",
